    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1001">

                <pb facs="0771" n="695" xml:id="pg695"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.48/3202</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Canada to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-22T10:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 22, 1916, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>English and other foreigners are besieging us for refuge on the boat. Refusing
                    them. What provisions will be made for them, if any.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canada</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
